# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST: everything in this repo is ignored unless it is listed below.
#
# Ansible Atlas output (the generated .html / .json maps) contains real
# hostnames, IPs and variable values from whatever repo it was run on.
# Ignoring everything by default means a generated map, a copied inventory,
# a vault password file or a stray .env can't be committed by accident,
# whatever its name or location.
#
# Adding a new file to the project? Allow it explicitly here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/
!/.githooks/
!/atlas.py
!/viewer/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/SECURITY.md
!/example-repo/
!/tests/

# Even inside allowed folders, never commit generated or local-only files.
*.html
!/viewer/index.html
*.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md
*.json
*.bundle
*.zip
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*vault_pass*
*.retry
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
